        },
        {
          "name": "runway threshold",
          "kind": "kind"
        }
      ],
      "note": "'plowed- snow-covered' are describing words left out of 'runway'."
    },
    {
      "id": "2e6c8a6f93e2",
      "doc_id": "documents/beech_a36_accidents.md",
      "text": "Subsequently, the airplane touchdown in an area of unplowed snow, impacted a snow berm, and the nosewheel collapsed.",
      "mentions": [
        {
          "name": "airplane",
          "kind": "kind"
        },
        {
          "name": "unplowed snow",
          "kind": "kind"
        },
        {
          "name": "impacted",
