        }
      ],
      "note": "Altitude value is a quantity (Out 4)."
    },
    {
      "id": "2c56065e5dec",
      "doc_id": "documents/beech_a36_accidents.md",
      "text": "It is likely the engine failure was the result of oil starvation to the connecting rod bearings, however, the reason for the oil starvation could not be determined based on the available evidence.",
      "mentions": [
