    },
    {
      "id": "5864f7c5bdf2",
      "doc_id": "documents/cessna_172s_accidents.md",
      "text": "Given this evidence, the “B” nut on the fuel line was likely not properly tightened during engine installation, which allowed the nut to loosen with normal engine vibration and allowed air to enter the system which resulted in total loss of engine power.",
      "mentions": [
        {
          "name": "“B” nut",
          "kind": "kind"
