        },
        {
          "name": "engine vibration",
          "kind": "kind"
        },
        {
          "name": "air",
          "kind": "kind"
        },
        {
          "name": "loss of engine power",
          "kind": "kind"
        }
      ],
      "note": "'tightened' kept though negated (In 3, In 4); 'the nut' is the same B nut; 'the system' and 'evidence' treated as generic."
    },
    {
