    {
      "id": "6c6be396d659",
      "doc_id": "documents/cessna_172s_accidents.md",
      "text": "During the takeoff roll, a louder noise occurred and shortly after the airplane lifted off the ground, the pilot elected to abort the takeoff and pitched nose down.",
