    {
      "id": "df604f73864f",
      "doc_id": "documents/cirrus_sr22_accidents.md",
      "text": "The pilot flew a visual approach to the airport, where several witnesses observed the airplane bounce on the runway then heard an increase in engine power, consistent with the pilot’s attempt to initiate a go-around.",
      "mentions": [
